Sabas Project Authors
=====================

The Sabas font family is designed and engineered by the Sabas Project.

Contributors
------------
See the git log for a full list of contributors:
  git log --format="%aN <%aE>" | sort -u

Reserved Font Names
-------------------
  Sabas
  Sabas UI
  Sabas Mono
  Sabas Display
